    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "Delegates receive this message when the session has finished the deferred start.",
      "ko": "세션이 지연 시작을 완료하면 delegate는 이 메시지를 받습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "3e00457baafff6e00c8d30a6a29407899d462a1acb84b93d03bcdf35472b4cc4",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "This message will be sent regardless of whether the session’s [`automaticallyRunsDeferredStart`](avcapturesession/automaticallyrunsdeferredstart.md) property is set.",
      "ko": "이 메시지는 세션의 [`automaticallyRunsDeferredStart`](avcapturesession/automaticallyrunsdeferredstart.md) 속성 설정 여부와 상관없이 전송됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "79534f09dbedbed012cc09256f21b242f3ffc6174554e6347a1f981f5b7fc311",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "source": "See [`setDeferredStartDelegate(_:deferredStartDelegateCallbackQueue:)`](avcapturesession/setdeferredstartdelegate(_:deferredstartdelegatecallbackqueue:).md) documentation for more information.",
      "ko": "자세한 내용은 [`setDeferredStartDelegate(_:deferredStartDelegateCallbackQueue:)`](avcapturesession/setdeferredstartdelegate(_:deferredstartdelegatecallbackqueue:).md) 문서를 참조합니다.",
